{"id":"vod_jy_107812","vodId":"107812","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"东京猫猫（中文版）","name_cn":"东京猫猫（中文版）","date":"2002-01-01","year":"2002","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第50集已完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/38e992c1653faa1186dfd8998a86177d.jpg"},"summary":"一次意外中，桃宫草莓（中岛沙树 配音）的DNA中混入了山猫的DNA，之后，一系列奇怪的变化发生在了她的身体上，她的行为举止越来越像一只猫咪，并且，在草莓的周围，开始出现了一些形状可怖的袭击者。喵喵咖啡馆的店长赤坂圭一郎（绿川光 配音）找到草莓，他告诉他，世界的和平正在受到威胁，只有一种名叫喵喵水晶石的宝物才能阻止恶势力的扩张，他希望草莓能够利用自己的超能力来寻找这些水晶石。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-04-09 13:20:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bkRZEnJa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e312Wgpb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/axkvX0Pe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bo2QLzXa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dJ6q5wKd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bqxYN47a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bmZQJpRd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bkRZE36a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/av2oVB8a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e312WNRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e5y9YvXe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/azpKZg2d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/av2oV15a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dJ6q5nyd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/egJLzokd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bo2QLBLa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/av2oVyna/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dBBL4JQd/index.m3u8"},{"nam